Hi {Owner},

I build websites for law firms around {City}. {Business Name} has a strong bench, but the site lists lawyers without a way to filter by practice or office, and every new enquiry lands in one inbox.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: practice group and industry pages, a lawyer finder by practice, office and language, intake with a conflict question that routes to the right team, an insights hub and a careers section for students and laterals, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, new profiles and insights. The firm approves every page before launch. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth twenty minutes with you and your marketing lead this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
